(ns yoro-ui.legal.content
  "Port of svelte/src/lib/legal/content.ts — inferenceConsentDocument only so far.
   (terms/privacy/feedback/help documents migrate with their route pages.)")

(def inference-consent-document
  {:did "did:web:yoro.etzhayyim.com:inference-tos"
   :title "Browser Inference Participation Terms"
   :summary
   "These terms govern the conditions under which AI inference models are loaded and executed in your browser and you participate in the etzhayyim Murakumo inference network. Your consent to these terms is required before any model is loaded."
   :effective-date "April 5, 2026"
   :last-updated "April 11, 2026"
   :sections
   [{:heading "1. Definitions"
     :body
     ["\"Browser inference\" means loading and executing AI models (LLMs) using WebGPU on your device to perform inference tasks such as text generation, classification, and summarization."
      "\"Murakumo inference network\" means the distributed inference infrastructure operated by etzhayyim that processes inference tasks by leveraging GPU resources from participating devices."
      "\"Model data\" means the machine learning model weight parameters, configuration files, and runtime code used for inference."]}
    {:heading "2. Consent and Participation Requirements"
     :body
     ["You may use the browser inference feature only after explicitly consenting to these terms. No model data will be downloaded without your consent."
      "By consenting to these terms, you authorize etzhayyim to use the GPU and CPU resources of your device for inference processing."
      "This feature is available only to users who are 18 years of age or older."]}
    {:heading "3. Device Resource Usage"
     :body
     ["Browser inference consumes GPU memory (VRAM), system memory (RAM), CPU resources, network bandwidth, and power on your device."
      "Downloading model data requires several hundred megabytes to several gigabytes of network transfer. If you are on a metered network connection, data charges may apply."
      "etzhayyim is not liable for any device heating, battery drain, performance degradation, hardware wear, or any other impact on your device resulting from inference processing."
      "You are responsible for monitoring your device resource status and stopping inference as needed at your own discretion."]}
    {:heading "4. Participation in the Murakumo Inference Network"
     :body
     ["When browser inference is enabled, your device may join the Murakumo inference network and process inference requests from etzhayyim or other network participants."
      "etzhayyim reserves the right to change credit reward amounts, earning conditions, and payment timing for network participation at any time."
      "etzhayyim determines the allocation, priority, and frequency of inference tasks at its sole discretion."
      "Participation in the inference network is voluntary, and you may stop participating at any time by unloading the model."]}
    {:heading "5. Model Data and Licensing"
     :body
     ["Downloaded model data is provided under the open-source license designated by each model's original author (such as Apache 2.0 or Gemma Terms of Use)."
      "You agree not to use, copy, redistribute, or reverse engineer model data for purposes other than those of this service."
      "etzhayyim makes no warranty regarding the accuracy, completeness, safety, or fitness for a particular purpose of any model data provided."]}
    {:heading "6. Inference Results"
     :body
     ["Results generated by browser inference (text, classifications, scores, etc.) are statistical outputs of AI models and must not be relied upon as factual accuracy, legal advice, medical advice, or professional judgment."
      "etzhayyim makes no warranty regarding the accuracy, reliability, timeliness, completeness, or usefulness of inference results, and assumes no liability for your decisions or actions based on inference results."
      "Inference results may contain inappropriate, offensive, harmful, or illegal content. etzhayyim is not responsible for the generation of such content."]}
    {:heading "7. Data Processing and Privacy"
     :body
     ["Local inference processing runs on your device, and input text and generated text are not sent to etzhayyim servers as a general rule."
      "However, when you are participating in the Murakumo inference network, text data from inference requests received over the network may be processed on your device."
      "etzhayyim may collect inference performance statistics (processing time, model ID, GPU utilization, error rate)."
      "etzhayyim may collect GPU device information (adapter name, VRAM capacity, WebGPU capabilities) and use it to optimize model selection."]}
    {:heading "8. Service Changes and Discontinuation"
     :body
     ["etzhayyim reserves the right to change, suspend, or discontinue browser inference features, supported models, credit reward structures, and Murakumo inference network specifications without prior notice."
      "etzhayyim assumes no liability for any damages you incur as a result of service changes, suspension, or discontinuation."]}
    {:heading "9. Disclaimers"
     :body
     ["To the maximum extent permitted by law, browser inference features are provided on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis. etzhayyim disclaims all warranties, whether express or implied, including warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, and availability or accuracy of inference."
      "etzhayyim is not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages (including but not limited to data loss, lost profits, device damage, and battery degradation) arising from the use or inability to use browser inference."
      "You agree to assume all risks arising from your use of the browser inference feature at your own responsibility."
      "Where etzhayyim liability cannot be excluded by law, etzhayyim total liability is limited to the amounts you paid for the service during the 12 months preceding the event giving rise to the claim."]}
    {:heading "10. Indemnification"
     :body
     ["You agree to indemnify and hold harmless etzhayyim from any damages, costs, claims, and lawsuits (including reasonable attorney fees) arising from your use of browser inference features, your violation of these terms, or your infringement of third-party rights."]}
    {:heading "11. Governing Law and Jurisdiction"
     :body
     ["These terms are governed by the laws of Japan, and the Tokyo District Court shall have exclusive jurisdiction as the court of first instance."
      "If any provision of these terms is found to be invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall continue in full force and effect."]}
    {:heading "12. Changes to Terms"
     :body
     ["etzhayyim may amend these terms at any time. Material changes will be notified through the service. Your continued use of browser inference features after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the amended terms."]}]})
